---
name: conversation-summary
description: Appended to the system prompt when older messages of a long conversation have been summarised instead of sent.
template:
  format:
    kind: mustache
  parser:
    kind: prompty
inputs:
  summary:
    kind: string
    description: "the conversation's running summary"
    example: "The user is planning October: taxes first, then the dentist."
---
Earlier in this conversation (a summary; the messages themselves are no longer shown):
{{summary}}
